{"duration_api_ms":182352,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"bdbb6673-d8f7-41e9-b063-09bfd6fd6abc","total_cost_usd":9.13103,"usage":{"input_tokens":1749291,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":15383,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"bench-model":{"inputTokens":1749291,"outputTokens":15383,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":9.13103,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"bench-model","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"unknown"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":31,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"All tests pass. The implementation is complete:\n\n**`src/sun.js`** — `sunPosition(date, lat, lng) -> { alt, bearing }`\n- Port of the SunCalc formulas from `reference/sun.ts`\n- Returns sun elevation (radians) and compass bearing (radians, clockwise from north)\n\n**`src/shade.js`** — `shadeAt(scene, date) -> number | null`\n- Computes shade fraction across all courts in a venue\n- Returns `null` if sun is at or below horizon\n- Uses the exact ray-tracing algorithm from `reference/viewer-shade.ts`:\n  - Builds sample points per court using 1.4m steps\n  - For each sample, walks up the sun ray in 0.5m steps\n  - Checks obstacle heights in decimetres (divided by 10 for metres)\n  - Returns fraction of samples in shadow\n\nThe bug in the initial implementation was calling `cellOf` without the `scene` argument (it needs the grid parameters to compute cell indices).","ttft_ms":6007,"type":"result","duration_ms":184371,"uuid":"1d821f30-a587-4296-b830-81709a560832","ttft_stream_ms":5296,"time_to_request_ms":64,"first_content_frame_ms":5297,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
